### 25. Valor zero -> 422 INVALID_EXPENSE_AMOUNT
POST {{host}}/api/finance/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "OTHER",
  "description": "Nada {{suffix}}",
  "amount": "0.00"
}

